            <!-- Problems / Solutions two-column grid -->
            <div class="row g-4 align-items-start">

                <!-- Problems column -->
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <div class="card p-4 h-100">
                        <h4 class="mb-3">Problems buyers face today</h4>

                        <ul class="mb-0" style="line-height:1.9;">
                            <li>
                                <strong>Opaque listings & hidden middlemen</strong> — buyers often find that a listing
                                has multiple agents or intermediaries who inflate prices or hide charges.
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <strong>Uncertain availability</strong> — you don't reliably know whether a plot is
                                already reserved or sold until you visit or call.
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <strong>Time-consuming site visits</strong> — inspecting multiple projects in-person
                                takes days and is costly.
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <strong>Scattered documentation</strong> — ownership records, approvals and title docs
                                are often fragmented and hard to verify quickly.
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <strong>Limited media & context</strong> — buyers rarely get high-quality photos, layout
                                plans, or neighborhood context before visiting.
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Solutions column -->
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <div class="card p-4 h-100">
                        <h4 class="mb-3">How Plotz solves them</h4>

                        <ul class="mb-0" style="line-height:1.9;">
                            <li>
                                <strong>No mediators by default</strong> — our platform surfaces verified seller
                                listings directly; interactions and offers are visible in-app so intermediaries cannot
                                secretly control listings.
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <strong>Real-time booking visibility</strong> — every plot shows its reservation/sale
                                status so you know instantly whether it is available.
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <strong>Venture & plot view on maps</strong> — view the entire venture on Google Maps
                                (satellite & street context), plus the exact plot boundaries and plot IDs on the map
                                itself.
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <strong>Complete plot details in one place</strong> — gallery images, site plans,
                                specifications, amenities, price breakdowns and developer disclosures live on the
                                listing.
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <strong>Documentation hub</strong> — upload and view title docs, approvals and
                                verification results associated with a listing to reduce surprises later.
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <strong>Mobile-first booking flow</strong> — reserve or request a site visit from your
                                phone; follow up with digital document exchange and payment options.
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

