                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <h4>How Plotz works — quick walkthrough</h4>
                    <ol style="line-height:1.9;">
                        <li>
                            <strong>Discover:</strong> Browse curated ventures or search by city and filters (budget,
                            plot size, amenities).
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <strong>Inspect remotely:</strong> Open the listing to view high-resolution photos, site
                            plans and the plotted boundary on the map. Check documents attached to the listing.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <strong>Verify availability:</strong> Real-time status shows whether a plot is available,
                            reserved or sold — no guesswork.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <strong>Reserve or request visit:</strong> Reserve a plot instantly via the app or request
                            an in-person visit. Reservation creates a timestamped record and notifies the seller.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <strong>Complete paperwork online:</strong> Exchange documents, request verification help
                            and coordinate payments with trusted partners — much of the interaction can happen
                            digitally.
                        </li>
                    </ol>
                </div>

                <div class="col-lg-6">
